{"title":"Greek alphabet","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Because European mathematics is very heavily rooted in the mathematics of ancient Greece, and due to the need for many symbols to represent <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Constant\" title=\"Constant\">constants</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Variable\" title=\"Variable\">variables</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Function\" title=\"Function\">functions</a> and other mathematical objects, mathematicians frequently use letters from the Greek alphabet in their work.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Greek_Letters\">Greek Letters</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Greek_alphabet&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Greek Letters\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Upper Case\n</th>\n<th>Lower Case\n</th>\n<th>Name\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>A\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/f/10f32377ac67d94f764f12a15ea987e88c85d3e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" />\n</td>\n<td>Alpha\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/b/fdb63b9e51abe6bbb16acfb5d7b773ddbb5bf4a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\beta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"10\" height=\"16\" />\n</td>\n<td>Beta\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/3/913e49ea63c6c130bb8d9d1c3556b052ecc404f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"14\" />\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/9/66981fa3920210c6ad8dbe5e968783d5dd7520c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"10\" height=\"11\" />\n</td>\n<td>Gamma\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/7/0a737670d481129e2ead6d7223437f3cf70ea53f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Delta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/4/0a42a8b725c200085e5253db2d2fbf8dab898a8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\delta$\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" />\n</td>\n<td>Delta\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a63918a6fa75b62ad87ad17aaf65f782d71546.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\varepsilon$\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" />\n</td>\n<td>Epsilon\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Z\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/a/fda38f45a64bbd4451aedeeb4584e01d91239172.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\zeta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"18\" />\n</td>\n<td>Zeta\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>H\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/a/03a45952f8115322d2879f7d090126f059757ba0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\eta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"9\" height=\"11\" />\n</td>\n<td>Eta\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/2/a321d1b883ba985b1f59ca076beaaf17aa8ab06c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/e/52e8ed7a3ba22130ad3984eb2cd413406475a689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />\n</td>\n<td>Theta\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>I\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/9/e394d1efd05a00d1e561e3dfa8deb80488d8a1a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\iota$\" width=\"6\" height=\"8\" />\n</td>\n<td>Iota\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>K\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/6/da61bb0fa48fe71269aebf9c8e56b39275813994.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\kappa$\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" />\n</td>\n<td>Kappa\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/2/2d295